    \n                                        {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the graph, we see ${lim}_{x\\to \\,2}f(x)=4.$\n\nWe factor the constant out of the limit and evaluate the remaining limit, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}Cf(x) & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ C\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 2}f(x) & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ C\\cdot 4 & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ C & =\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-131480/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b94d5612-763f-59d8-9a80-7f6e2f18fa6c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-131480"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131479/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "2d4d2b58-f3c9-5583-8ac5-76858282b532" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131479/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0928ec8c-abcd-539c-87f4-0a6ef78d2ff5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-131479/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-131479/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-131479/field-2/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934" :answer/id #uuid "3a0c0622-ed72-5243-920c-456f0841bfa9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\infty" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131479/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "e357a5e8-03ba-5690-b7a9-80839d7a3513" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-131479/field-2/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934" :answer-field/choices ["q-131479/field-2/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-131479" :quest